<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine property stock index soars 7.1 pct.</title>
<headline>Philippine property stock index soars 7.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippine property stocks index soared by 7.1 percent to 1,387.13 points by midtrade in Manila on Friday on news of a de facto devaluation of the peso.</p>
<p>&quot;The market is revolving around with reactions,&quot; said Joven Babaan, research head at SBC Warburg.</p>
</text>
